The DWS332 ZigBee Door/Window Sensor features 4-screw mounting on the main unit and 2-screw fixation on the magnetic strip, ensuring tamper-resistant installation. With ZigBee 3.0, it provides real-time monitoring for hotel automation systems.

## Key Features

- ZigBee 3.0
- Detects door and window openings and closings
- Tamper alerts if the sensor is removed
- Secure screw installation with additional security screw
- Long-lasting battery (2 years, CR2477)
- Low power consumption
- Magnetic strip with spacer for uneven surfaces (optional)
